    "testimonials": {
      "type": "smooche-testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "rev_margaret": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Margaret, 61",
            "asset_key": "margaret",
            "show_verified": true,
            "verified_label": "Verified purchase",
            "quote": "<p>\"I honestly thought my foundation days were over. At 61, everything I tried would settle into my smile lines within an hour and turn orange by lunch. I'd resigned myself to just using tinted moisturizer. Then my daughter bought me this for my birthday. I cried when I looked in the mirror. My skin looked like MY skin—just smoother, more even, more radiant. No lines emphasized. No orange. No mask. I'm 61 and I finally love wearing foundation again.\"</p>"
          }
        },
        "rev_jennifer": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Jennifer, 58",
            "asset_key": "jennifer",
            "show_verified": true,
            "verified_label": "Verified purchase",
            "quote": "<p>\"In 25 years, I've spent thousands on foundation. High-end, drugstore, luxury brands, custom-mixed—I tried it ALL. Nothing worked on my 54-year-old skin. They all settled into my pores, clung to dry patches, and oxidized. This is the first foundation that's made me look YOUNGER, not older. My husband asked if I'd done something to my face. That's when I knew this was different\"</p>"
          }
        },
        "rev_deborah": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Deborah, 63",
            "asset_key": "deborah",
            "show_verified": true,
            "verified_label": "Verified purchase",
            "quote": "<p>\"As a makeup artist for 30+ years, I've worked with every foundation on the market. I'm 63 and I've never found one that works this well on mature skin—including my own. The way it glides over texture instead of settling into it is remarkable. I've started recommending it to every client over 50. It's the only foundation I trust on aging skin\"</p>"
          }
        },
        "rev_mia": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Mia, 56",
            "asset_key": "mia",
            "show_verified": true,
            "verified_label": "Verified purchase",
            "quote": "<p>\"I've spent over $300 in the past year alone returning foundations that didn't work. Wrong shade, oxidized, settled into lines—you name it. I was terrified to try another one. But the shade-match guarantee convinced me to give it ONE more shot. I've been wearing it for 3 months now and I've never looked back. It's the only foundation I'll ever buy again. I'm 56 and my skin finally looks flawless.\"</p>"
          }
        },
        "rev_patricia": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Patricia, 58",
            "asset_key": "patricia",
            "show_verified": true,
            "verified_label": "Verified purchase",
            "quote": "<p>\"I'm a retired chemist, so I'm VERY skeptical of beauty marketing claims. 'Color-adapting'? Sure. But I tried it anyway because nothing else worked. I watched the formula literally transform on my skin—I could see it happening. Within 60 seconds it matched my exact tone, including the subtle pink undertone I can never find in stores. Eight hours later, still perfect. No oxidation. I actually went back and read the patent. This is real science, not marketing hype.\"</p>"
          }
        },
        "rev_susan": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Susan, 62",
            "asset_key": "susan",
            "show_verified": true,
            "verified_label": "Verified purchase",
            "quote": "<p>\"My 28-year-old daughter is a beauty influencer and she sent me this saying 'Mom, you NEED to try this.' I was skeptical—what works for her young skin won't work for my 62-year-old face. But she insisted. Ladies, LISTEN TO YOUR DAUGHTERS. This is magic. No settling, no oxidation, and it actually made me look 10 years younger. Even my doctor asked what I'd been doing differently. Best beauty purchase of my life.\"</p>"
          }
        }
