        "reverse": false,
        "fallback_asset": "smooche-adapts-img.png",
        "heading": "Foundation that",
        "heading_highlight": "adapts to you",
        "text": "<p>Meet the foundation that takes the guesswork out of beauty. Our color-changing formula adjusts seamlessly to fair to medium skin tones, giving you a radiant, natural finish that looks like your skin, only better. It blurs imperfections, softens fine lines, and neutralizes redness in seconds, all while protecting with SPF 15. One shade, endless confidence. Just apply, blend, and watch the transformation.</p>",
