    "faq": {
      "type": "smooche-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_apply": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to apply?",
            "content": "<p><strong>Step 1: Create the Perfect Canvas</strong><br>Start with moisturized skin. Smooth on your go-to primer or hydrating cream to create an even base that helps your foundation glide on seamlessly.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Build Your Base</strong><br>Dispense one pump onto the back of your hand. Using a brush, dot foundation on your forehead, cheeks, nose, and chin. Blend outward from the center of your face using circular motions for a naturally soft, medium coverage finish with a velvety matte texture.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Customize Your Coverage</strong><br>Want more coverage in specific areas? Layer a second application on any spots that need extra attention—blemishes, redness, or discoloration—and blend seamlessly into your base.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Lock It In</strong><br>Brighten under-eyes with your favorite concealer, then lightly dust translucent powder across your T-zone (forehead, nose, and chin) to control shine and keep your look fresh all day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_last": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does it last?",
            "content": "<p>Our long-wear formula is designed to stay put for up to 16 hours without fading, oxidizing, or transferring onto clothes or masks. The breathable, lightweight texture locks onto skin while still feeling comfortable, so you get all-day coverage that looks as fresh at 8 PM as it did at 8 AM.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_coverage": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the coverage like? Can I make it lighter or heavier?",
            "content": "<p>You're in complete control. One pump gives you natural, \"your skin but better\" medium coverage that evens tone and softens imperfections. Need more? Layer a second application on specific areas for full coverage that still looks like skin—never cakey or heavy. It's truly customizable to your needs each day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_breakout": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will it break me out or irritate sensitive skin?",
            "content": "<p>Our formula is dermatologist-tested, non-comedogenic (won't clog pores), and free from harsh irritants. We've also excluded common sensitizers like parabens, sulfates, and synthetic fragrances. In fact, 88% of users in our clinical study reported improved skin texture after just 2 weeks of use—it's skincare and makeup in one.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_guarantee": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does the money back guarantee work?",
            "content": "<p>Find your flawless shade with zero risk. Our Changing Foundation comes with a complete satisfaction promise: if your shade isn't spot-on, we'll make it right with a full refund—no questions asked.</p><p>We know finding the perfect foundation match online can feel like a gamble. That's why we've eliminated the risk entirely. Try it on your skin, in your lighting, with your routine. If it's not your perfect match, simply let us know within 30 days and we'll process your full refund immediately.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_ship": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where do you ship to?",
            "content": "<p>We offer free worldwide shipping! Shipping to 65+ countries. Please see our shipping policy to find your country and shipping times.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_return": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I return my order?",
            "content": "<p>All returns must be postmarked within fourteen (14) days of the delivery. All returned items must be in new and unused condition, in the original packaging. See our return policy for more info</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_duties": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I have to pay import duties and tax?",
            "content": "<p>No, you do not have to pay any import duties and tax. We aim to provide a hassle-free shopping experience, so the price you see is the price you pay. There are no hidden fees or additional charges at delivery. This ensures that you can enjoy our products without worrying about extra costs.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
